## TileDB loading benchmark (see cpp/docs/TILEDB_LOADING_BENCHMARK_RUNBOOK.md)
# Raw data/result dirs belong under /raid, outside the repo; these guard against
# accidentally pointing a run's data_dir/result_dir inside the working tree.
/wholememory-tiledb-loading-*/
/wholememory-tiledb-loading-results-*/
.benchmarks/
# Per-rank checkpoint files are redundant with the aggregate JSON/CSV and should
# only be committed deliberately (git add -f) when needed to diagnose a discrepancy.
nvme_benchmark_results/**/*.rank-*.json
